            <ArticleTitle>Barriers to effective pain/symptom control.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>107-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We have a challenging call to provide compassionate care and comfort in a changing and varied clinical, social and financial setting. Multiple variables including race, creed, age, and sex of the patient can impact the decision-making process. It is hoped that consideration by professional caregivers of the above barriers will improve and provide consistent care to those put in our charge.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
